.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750447422","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761830/178aada1e269885367027de1886485f4ccb02be7/ss_178aada1e269885367027de1886485f4ccb02be7.600x338.jpg?t=1750447422"}],"short_description":"1000 years ago, an alliance of humans and elves drove back the invasion of dragons. Peace was meant to return. Instead, humanity descended into endless bloodshed and tyranny. 1000 years later, the last surviving elves must defend their forests against man-made dragons forged from far deeper cruelty.","steam_appid":3761830,"support_info":{"email":"nowakindie@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}